# Snapshot goldens are compared byte for byte, line endings included: the
# emitters commit to LF on every platform (EmitCSharp's NormalizeWhitespace,
# Fantomas EndOfLineStyle.LF, Append('\n') in EmitTemplates), and the previous
# `Replace("\r\n", "\n")` in the comparison is *why* an Environment.NewLine
# defect survived a year unseen. A checkout that rewrote these to CRLF would
# fail the suite for a reason that has nothing to do with the code.
*.expected -text

# Emitted code the generator writes is LF by contract, in this repo and in
# every consumer's tree.
*.g.fs   text eol=lf
*.g.cs   text eol=lf
